<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Shelley returns about six months after resection of her meningioma. She has had no seizure since starting levetiracetam, about six and a half months ago, including during the stomach illness in August, when she vomited one dose. She drives again, keeps regular hours, and drinks little. Her mood is good; she finished her course with the counselor after eight sessions and says she can now speak of her old griefs without being undone by them. She writes every morning and has nearly finished her travel book. She has no headaches. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Seizures</td><td>None since starting levetiracetam</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>Good; counseling completed after eight sessions</td></tr><tr><td>Writing</td><td>Every morning; travel book nearly finished</td></tr><tr><td>Gastroenteritis</td><td>Resolved in four days</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

